<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-PILKINGTON CUP QUARTER-FINAL DRAW.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-PILKINGTON CUP QUARTER-FINAL DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The draw for the quarter-finals of the Pilkington Cup made on Monday:</p>
<p>Newcastle v Bath or Leicester</p>
<p>Wakefield v Gloucester</p>
<p>Northampton v Sale</p>
<p>Harlequins v Saracens</p>
<p>Matches to be played on Saturday, February 22.</p>
</text>
